    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/40c8ee98aae8feab831a7f91fe97b73d.avif?t=1751282960\" data-has-big width=800 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/c881bbef72cf7b152ebb6c8e13a2b307.poster.avif?t=1751282960\" width=800 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/c881bbef72cf7b152ebb6c8e13a2b307.webm?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/c881bbef72cf7b152ebb6c8e13a2b307.mp4?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary creatures started haunting your nightmares. Your doctor tells you to look for Memory Fragments hidden within your mind to figure out : what's causing these visions exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/25a2834613f1b815c2515d5c252aa2bd.poster.avif?t=1751282960\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/25a2834613f1b815c2515d5c252aa2bd.webm?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/25a2834613f1b815c2515d5c252aa2bd.mp4?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find these mysterious objects, you'll have to navigate dark hostile corridors... Be weary! As when your light runs out, the MonStalkers will start to chase you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/3908e23a156676515e9ecf306dbbfa94.poster.avif?t=1751282960\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/3908e23a156676515e9ecf306dbbfa94.webm?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/3908e23a156676515e9ecf306dbbfa94.mp4?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Filled with traps, these grounds are dangerous. It has been said that many who roamed too deep inside of them never returned with their full sanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to face your fears?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/40c8ee98aae8feab831a7f91fe97b73d.avif?t=1751282960\" data-has-big width=800 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/c881bbef72cf7b152ebb6c8e13a2b307.poster.avif?t=1751282960\" width=800 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/c881bbef72cf7b152ebb6c8e13a2b307.webm?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/c881bbef72cf7b152ebb6c8e13a2b307.mp4?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary creatures started haunting your nightmares. Your doctor tells you to look for Memory Fragments hidden within your mind to figure out : what's causing these visions exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/25a2834613f1b815c2515d5c252aa2bd.poster.avif?t=1751282960\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/25a2834613f1b815c2515d5c252aa2bd.webm?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/25a2834613f1b815c2515d5c252aa2bd.mp4?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find these mysterious objects, you'll have to navigate dark hostile corridors... Be weary! As when your light runs out, the MonStalkers will start to chase you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/3908e23a156676515e9ecf306dbbfa94.poster.avif?t=1751282960\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/3908e23a156676515e9ecf306dbbfa94.webm?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645430/extras/3908e23a156676515e9ecf306dbbfa94.mp4?t=1751282960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Filled with traps, these grounds are dangerous. It has been said that many who roamed too deep inside of them never returned with their full sanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to face your fears?</p>",
